[00:36.08]Jehovah, our Father in heaven,
[00:42.76]Oh, this is a most sacred night!
[00:51.66]It was then, long ago, you determined to show
[01:00.44]Your love, justice, wisdom, and might.
[01:08.08]The Passover lamb gave protection,
[01:15.38]And your favored people were freed.
[01:24.82]Cent’ries later our Lord his own lifeblood outpoured
[01:33.18]To fulfill this divine prophecy.
[01:46.68]The bread and the wine are reminders,
[01:53.76]How great is the price that you paid.
[02:02.62]And the good that was done
[02:06.06]through the gift of your Son,
[02:11.34]In life and in death he obeyed.
[02:18.94]We gratefully keep this Memorial;
[02:26.18]This night is a time to recall
[02:32.83]How the death of your Son
[02:39.42]paid the ransom that won
[02:44.32]The redemption from death for us all.
[02:57.58]We’re gathered together before you.
[03:05.58]At your invitation we’ve come
[03:11.62]To give praise for your love that brought
[03:19.34]Christ from above
[03:23.04]And honor to you and your Son.
[03:30.58]The Lord’s Ev’ning Meal brings you glory
[03:37.30]And strengthens our heart and our mind.
[03:47.92]So we’ll walk ev’ry day as Christ showed us the way,
[03:56.76]And then life everlasting we’ll find.
